{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the successor to the original installment, <i>Leyline Chronicles 2</i> brings the epic journey of the Ley-Sensitives\u2014led by Lambert and Maiev\u2014to its dramatic conclusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the stakes are higher than ever: not just one world, but all worlds connected through the Leylines hang in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the group on a multi-world-spanning adventure that ties together fate, legacy, and power in the final chapter of the <i>Leyline Chronicles</i> saga. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/948cbbfe4a9e290edf549b581cc00158.poster.avif?t=1752497876\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/948cbbfe4a9e290edf549b581cc00158.webm?t=1752497876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/948cbbfe4a9e290edf549b581cc00158.mp4?t=1752497876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the strength of 8 distinct heroes in fast-paced, combo-driven battles where every move counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who plan ahead\u2014who think about their offense, defense and when to unleash devastating team techniques\u2014will survive the relentless tide of enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/e73418a79eff425112c016f202341f88.poster.avif?t=1752497876\" width=680 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/e73418a79eff425112c016f202341f88.webm?t=1752497876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/e73418a79eff425112c016f202341f88.mp4?t=1752497876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Delve deep into the fabric of the world, where forgotten paths, ancient relics, and echoes of the past lie hidden beyond plain sight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every secret you uncover brings you closer to the truth behind the Leylines\u2014and the forces that seek to control them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/ea335fc0a2f70e69006cf719a54a43f7.poster.avif?t=1752497876\" width=678 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/ea335fc0a2f70e69006cf719a54a43f7.webm?t=1752497876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/ea335fc0a2f70e69006cf719a54a43f7.mp4?t=1752497876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your path to victory by upgrading your gear, crafting powerful equipment, or brewing unique potions to aid you in the battles ahead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters as you prepare to bring this story to its final chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the weight of the journey grows heavy, each world offers its own mini-games\u2014small moments of levity and challenge for those in need of a break from fate itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/e97adf32c5983835e28ca76a32694e5a.avif?t=1752497876\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras_big/e97adf32c5983835e28ca76a32694e5a.avif?t=1752497876 width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Be there when the final chapter unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a part of the chronicles. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras/8eafd9029dd038c3948eff1ae93600bd.avif?t=1752497876\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/extras_big/8eafd9029dd038c3948eff1ae93600bd.avif?t=1752497876 width=800 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726090?t=1752497876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/8aafcbc4ecdbd5b00081fcc9744e6456938ed9d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752497876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/da5d71ed5988c7b0ef747b8b0ca590b773f63b10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752497876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726090/da5d71ed5988c7b0ef747b8b0ca590b773f63b10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752497876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the successor to the original installment, <i>Leyline Chronicles 2</i> brings the epic journey of the Ley-Sensitives\u201